"hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2931,"###
 Muhammad bin Aban narrated to us, saying: Bishr bin as-Sarri narrated to us, from Aban al-Attar, from Yahya bin Abi Kathir. And Muhammad bin Rafi narrated to us, saying: Musa bin Ismail narrated to us, informing us that Aban narrated to us, saying: Yahya narrated to us, that Abu Salamah narrated to him, saying: Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Zaid informed him, saying: His father (Abdullah bin Zaid) witnessed the"
2932,"Narrated to us Ahmad ibn Sa‘īd al-Darāmī (RA):
Narrated to us Ḥassān – meaning Ibn Hilāl (RA):
Narrated to us Abān (RA):
Narrated to us Yaḥyā (RA) with this chain to the same effect.

And also narrated to us al-Darāmī (RA):
Narrated to us ‘Abd al-Ṣamad (RA):
Narrated to us Abān (RA):
Narrated to us Yaḥyā (RA):
Narrated to us Abū Salamah (RA) that Muḥammad ibn ‘Abd Allāh ibn Zayd (RA) narrated to him that his father (RA) narrated to him.

Al-Darāmī (RA) said: He then mentioned the story and said: Abū Bakr (i.e., al-Bukhārī) said, “None has said that his father narrated to him except ‘Abd al-Ṣamad.”

**CHAPTER:**"
